        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Tucked within a mountain-ringed basin, Conservation Area 368 is a small settlement scarcely more than a village, its permanent population never exceeding three hundred."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "It lies cupped by sheer cliffs that plunge a thousand meters, a stark, mineral-rich bowl."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Once, prospectors and traders were drawn here in a feverish rush for fortune. Now, the bustle is gone."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Only a few dozen structures remain, huddled around the conservation area's heart: a modest Central Purification Filter."
