        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Liv",
            "This area is quite remote, and the mining sector has been abandoned for a long time. There aren't many people left here, mostly just those who couldn't evacuate during the Punishing Virus outbreak. So the foot traffic is very light.",
