        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liv",
            "From this list, I've already looked into two of them. We can probably rule them out... they were both severely injured and in a deep coma the night of the incident. They're still being treated at the medical station.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liv",
            "And, two others left yesterday for the mining area. They mentioned they were going to collect minerals and supplies for trading.",
